{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29670","headline":"昭肃皇帝挽歌辞三首 二 · 李商隐","name":"昭肃皇帝挽歌辞三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉塞惊宵柝，金桥罢举烽。\n始巢阿阁凤，旋驾鼎湖龙。\n门咽通神鼓，楼凝警夜钟。\n小臣观吉从，犹误欲东封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}